      "content": "thanks for the reassurance. i'll do the cold packs. i was reading online about tetanus though and it said deep puncture wounds from rusty tools are pretty high risk for it. since i can't get a shot tonight, can i just take some high dose antibiotics i have left over from a sinus infection a few months ago? i figured if i get ahead of the infection now i won't need to worry about it until i can see a doctor next week.",
